an></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,P\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A,P\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(d_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 分别为实数的通常拓扑与通常度量（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" href=\"?note=f6afc84fe5b2b44e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md\">../batch08/58-df-perfect.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\in V\">\\(\\aleph_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\land\n\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land |A|&gt;\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(P\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}set\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\land\n\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land |A|&gt;\\aleph_0\n\\to\n\\exists P\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(P\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\mathrm{Perfect}_S(P,\\mathbb R,d_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every uncountable Borel set contains a nonempty perfect subset in the explicitly supplied Euclidean metric space.</li>\n<li>This is the perfect set theorem for Borel sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-perfect.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6afc84fe5b2b44e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-perfect.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-thm-perfect-set-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c53f8b465048897","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin